; taxjson.com — GitHub Pages. Import as a BIND zone file (Cloudflare: DNS → Import and Export;
; Squarespace/Google Domains: DNS → Import; Route 53: Import zone file). Remove any parking
; A/CNAME records on the apex first. TTL 3600 is fine; lower it while propagating if you like.
$ORIGIN taxjson.com.
$TTL 3600
@       IN  A       185.199.108.153
@       IN  A       185.199.109.153
@       IN  A       185.199.110.153
@       IN  A       185.199.111.153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8000::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8001::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8002::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8003::153
www     IN  CNAME   taxjson.github.io.
